Error [jet.ViewOutlivesOwner]: `edit` cannot be shared — it does not live long enough to be stored in a struct field
  --> tests/ui/ownership/write_window_cannot_be_stored.jet:6:29
    |
  6 |     holder: Holder{ window: edit }
    |                             ^^^^
 Why: `edit` is a view into `xs`; sharing it outside `xs`'s scope would let it outlive its owner and point into freed storage
 Fix: Keep `edit` inside `xs`'s scope, or copy what you need before it leaves
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305

Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `xs[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `holder`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/write_window_cannot_be_stored.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     holder: Holder{ window: edit }
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
